ACPC New Leaf Graphics Mod is an add-on for FlyingMeta's ACGC-PC-Port (https://github.com/flyngmt/ACGC-PC-Port).
This repository distributes only the mod's overlay and setup tools. It does not redistribute the upstream project or its compiled game.
Players obtain ACGC-PC-Port 0.9.3 directly from the upstream page; the setup applies this mod's overlay to a local copy.

The upstream project contains code from ACreTeam/ac-decomp (CC0 1.0) and the PC port layer by FlyingMeta (MIT).
The overlay modifies upstream files and adds mod code; those portions retain their applicable upstream terms. The MIT license below
preserves FlyingMeta's copyright notice and also covers the mod's original additions unless a file says otherwise.

The mod requires the player's own legally obtained GameCube and New Leaf game dumps. Animal Crossing is a Nintendo trademark.
This project is an independent fan project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo or FlyingMeta.

Bundled third-party tools keep their own licenses; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

